<section class="shell band">
  <h1>Fees and policies</h1>
  <div class="answer">
    <p>Individual therapy is <strong>$240</strong> for a 50-minute online session, self-pay.
    Trail walk and movement therapy is <strong>$240 to $370</strong> depending on session
    length. LPC supervision is <strong>$425 a month</strong>. EMDR consultation is
    <strong>$185</strong> an hour. <strong>Blue Cross Blue Shield is accepted</strong>; other
    clients, and major credit cards are the accepted form of payment.</p>
  </div>

